      "message": "chore(claude): share the project's agents and skills; keep settings, worktrees and lock files local\n\n- .gitignore: /.claude/* stays ignored except agents/ and skills/; lock\n  files under .claude are ignored everywhere.\n- .claude/agents: gate-runner, graph-updater, PR-reviewer.\n- .claude/skills: review-prs.\n- Machine-specific absolute paths replaced with repo-relative ones\n  (`git rev-parse --show-toplevel`, \"the main checkout\").\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
